/-!
# Actual step-zero readout graphs

Generated by gen_s0a.py. Imported helper ciphertexts and encrypted switching
tables are proved from the actual run. The remaining member and Fourier
premises are explicit, uniformly quantified over members and table branches.
-/

set_option maxHeartbeats 64000000
set_option maxRecDepth 16384
set_option Elab.async false

namespace Dio2Proof.Online0Sources
open Mxx.Primitives MxxRuntime MxxExponentLut Mxx.ExponentLut.Refresh
